        rdfs:comment      "General: Model state is Internal Test because this represents a standard annotation." , "General: Published in https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34710644 , model 1 for transcription activator with Atf1 as the concrete example (see Evaluation Section). Note that the GO-CAM guidelines have changed since publication of the paper, and 'has part' DNA binding is not captured in the new guidelines; it is considered to be an implicit part of GO:0001228, and does not need to be captured as a separate MF." ;
